WEBVTT

00:02.043 --> 00:04.754
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:33.259 --> 01:34.928
I can’t believe it!

01:35.637 --> 01:38.640
Serving anyone other than Lady Gyokuyou?!

01:39.265 --> 01:40.850
<i>Even if you say that…</i>

01:41.643 --> 01:42.477
There’s…

01:43.061 --> 01:46.397
There’s a ghost…

01:46.481 --> 01:47.732
in the palace bathhouse!

01:51.111 --> 01:54.739
Why not consult
Lord Jinshi about it first?

01:55.615 --> 01:57.200
<i>After hearing something like that,</i>

01:57.283 --> 01:59.911
<i>there’s no way I can just ignore it.</i>

02:02.163 --> 02:04.791
-Maomao.
<i>-As expected.</i>

02:04.874 --> 02:07.669
<i>The task has fallen to me.</i>

02:08.253 --> 02:09.420
You called for me?

02:16.928 --> 02:18.638
<i>Damn.</i>

02:18.721 --> 02:20.932
<i>I got an ox bezoar and completely forgot,</i>

02:21.015 --> 02:24.352
<i>but during that last hunt,</i>
<i>I learned an outrageous secret.</i>

02:24.435 --> 02:26.396
<i>All men in the rear palace,</i>

02:26.479 --> 02:29.357
<i>aside from the Emperor, are eunuchs.</i>

02:29.440 --> 02:31.359
<i>However, Lord Jinshi is not.</i>

02:31.442 --> 02:34.112
<i>He possesses a rather impressive frog.</i>

02:37.949 --> 02:40.160
So, what is your request today?

02:40.827 --> 02:43.621
It seems that a ghost has been appearing
in a certain consort’s chambers.

02:43.705 --> 02:47.584
Oh my, how dreadful.

02:49.168 --> 02:51.129
Which consort is it?

02:51.212 --> 02:52.964
I must go visit her.

02:53.047 --> 02:54.382
Lady Gyokuyou,

02:54.465 --> 02:57.260
you mustn’t go outside in your condition.

02:57.343 --> 02:59.262
In that case, I shall send someone.

02:59.846 --> 03:01.472
You're right.

03:01.556 --> 03:04.517
Hongniang, how about

03:04.601 --> 03:06.352
you and Maomao go together?

03:06.436 --> 03:10.189
Lady Gyokuyou,
this is a confidential matter,

03:10.273 --> 03:12.191
so please refrain from visiting.

03:12.901 --> 03:14.527
With that in mind,

03:14.611 --> 03:17.196
may I have her back?

03:18.072 --> 03:20.700
If you'd like to "borrow" her,
I’ll give her to you.

03:25.121 --> 03:26.873
<i>This exchange again?</i>

03:27.749 --> 03:30.293
No, I want you to "return" her.

03:31.085 --> 03:33.755
Return Maomao to me.

03:35.465 --> 03:36.883
Once I'm done and give her to you,

03:36.966 --> 03:39.719
no matter what you ask her,

03:40.470 --> 03:41.471
she won’t say a word.

03:42.388 --> 03:44.599
I’ll make sure of that.

03:46.643 --> 03:49.270
Well, let’s be on our way.

03:59.072 --> 04:02.367
You two…
Did something happen during the hunt?

04:03.660 --> 04:05.578
It's because of a frog.

04:06.871 --> 04:07.747
A frog?

04:08.665 --> 04:11.626
<i>Considering the secret</i>
<i>I have to take to my grave,</i>

04:11.709 --> 04:14.254
<i>maybe the ox bezoar wasn't worth it.</i>

04:15.713 --> 04:17.006
We've been expecting you.

04:25.473 --> 04:28.935
<i>Just how much does Lord Gaoshun know?</i>

04:29.435 --> 04:33.398
<i>Or perhaps, he is also not a eunuch?</i>

04:34.732 --> 04:37.402
<i>Never mind.</i>
<i>Thinking about it won’t change anything.</i>

04:41.281 --> 04:43.408
Good day, Lady Lishu.

04:44.534 --> 04:45.368
Lord Jinshi!

04:45.451 --> 04:46.744
Could you guide us to

04:46.828 --> 04:50.123
the bathhouse where the ghost was seen?

04:51.749 --> 04:52.583
Yes.

04:53.751 --> 04:55.503
<i>Aren't they being a little too obvious?</i>

04:55.586 --> 04:59.215
<i>For a high-ranking consort,</i>
<i>this is quite concerning.</i>

04:59.882 --> 05:01.050
This way.

05:03.720 --> 05:07.015
The changing room is in the front,
and the bath is in the back.

05:08.558 --> 05:11.644
But Lady Lishu saw the strange shadow

05:11.728 --> 05:13.980
from this storage room window.

05:15.315 --> 05:17.066
What kind of shadow did you see?

05:17.650 --> 05:19.152
W-Well…

05:20.361 --> 05:23.072
Are you still going on about that?

05:23.156 --> 05:25.700
It must have been a trick of the light.

05:25.783 --> 05:29.954
Lady Lishu just wants attention.

05:32.415 --> 05:36.836
Making such a fuss over something trivial.

05:36.919 --> 05:38.296
It is

05:39.005 --> 05:42.717
a head lady-in-waiting’s duty
to correct such behavior.

05:43.301 --> 05:45.178
Or do former food tasters

05:45.261 --> 05:47.972
not even understand that?

05:48.056 --> 05:49.474
My apologies.

05:49.557 --> 05:51.476
<i>Judging by her tone,</i>

05:51.559 --> 05:54.562
<i>that arrogant attendant</i>
<i>must be the former head lady-in-waiting.</i>

05:54.645 --> 05:57.231
<i>Losing her position to the food taster</i>

05:57.315 --> 06:00.693
<i>must have left her bitter enough</i>
<i>to spew sarcasm daily.</i>

06:03.571 --> 06:05.323
<i>That hairpin…?</i>

06:06.240 --> 06:08.326
Don’t you agree?

06:09.077 --> 06:10.661
Perhaps.

06:11.496 --> 06:15.541
However, listening to the consorts
is also my duty.

06:15.625 --> 06:18.002
Could you refrain from taking over my job?

06:19.545 --> 06:20.421
Understood.

06:23.341 --> 06:25.134
I feel a bit thirsty.

06:26.427 --> 06:28.096
I’ll bring tea at once!

06:28.179 --> 06:30.473
-I will!
-No, let me!

06:30.556 --> 06:32.225
Let me!

06:32.308 --> 06:34.519
Now then, Lady Lishu,

06:34.602 --> 06:36.312
please tell me in detail.

06:38.564 --> 06:39.816
Y… Yes.

06:41.567 --> 06:44.570
<i>He sent everyone away to make sure</i>
<i>Lady Lishu doesn’t shrink back.</i>

06:45.363 --> 06:49.826
It happened after my usual bath.

06:50.743 --> 06:52.995
<i>I actually prefer lukewarm water,</i>

06:53.079 --> 06:55.832
<i>but the maids always prepare hot baths,</i>

06:56.666 --> 07:00.211
<i>so I make it a habit to bathe</i>
<i>a little later when the water cools.</i>

07:01.212 --> 07:03.089
<i>I kind of knew,</i>

07:04.090 --> 07:05.925
<i>but the maids</i>

07:06.008 --> 07:08.553
<i>don’t seem too fond of me.</i>

07:09.345 --> 07:12.807
<i>Since my time in the nunnery,</i>
<i>I’ve always bathed alone.</i>

07:13.349 --> 07:16.227
<i>Only Kanan, I mean…</i>

07:16.310 --> 07:19.063
<i>the head lady-in-waiting,</i>
<i>helped me with my clothes.</i>

07:19.564 --> 07:21.357
<i>When I was wiping myself dry,</i>

07:21.441 --> 07:24.277
<i>I felt hot, so I lifted the blinds.</i>

07:24.360 --> 07:28.281
<i>Even though the window was shut,</i>

07:28.364 --> 07:30.241
<i>the curtain swayed.</i>

07:31.576 --> 07:34.036
<i>And there, grinning, was a white face…</i>

07:34.120 --> 07:35.872
<i>dancing.</i>

07:37.081 --> 07:40.042
While staring… right at me.

07:44.630 --> 07:47.758
Could there have been someone nearby?

07:49.135 --> 07:51.888
No. Kanan was the only one close by.

07:51.971 --> 07:54.557
She saw the same ghost too!

07:55.850 --> 07:58.603
When I tried to get closer to identify it…

07:59.395 --> 08:01.397
<i>The ghost vanished,</i>

08:02.190 --> 08:06.444
<i>and the curtain suddenly stopped moving.</i>

08:07.612 --> 08:11.616
<i>The windows leading outside were all shut,</i>

08:11.699 --> 08:13.784
<i>so there was no wind.</i>

08:13.868 --> 08:16.704
<i>And yet, the curtain swayed.</i>

08:18.122 --> 08:21.209
<i>No wonder they were frightened</i>
<i>and believed it was a ghost.</i>

08:21.959 --> 08:24.253
<i>But this layout is odd.</i>

08:24.337 --> 08:26.422
<i>In the Crystal and Jade Pavilion,</i>

08:26.506 --> 08:28.508
<i>the bathhouses are separate structures</i>

08:28.591 --> 08:30.718
<i>with lounging areas.</i>

08:31.594 --> 08:35.264
<i>Who builds a storage room</i>
<i>next to a bathhouse?</i>

08:38.476 --> 08:41.437
Was that room originally a storage room?

08:42.271 --> 08:44.357
No, it wasn't…

08:44.982 --> 08:48.319
-Then why did they turn it into storage?
-That's because…

08:52.323 --> 08:55.868
If you look here, you’ll understand.

09:01.999 --> 09:03.209
I see.

09:03.876 --> 09:05.962
It’s covered in mold.

09:06.587 --> 09:08.297
<i>The maids of the Jade Pavilion</i>

09:08.381 --> 09:09.924
<i>would have investigated</i>

09:10.007 --> 09:12.468
<i>and prevented mold from forming,</i>

09:13.052 --> 09:16.138
<i>but expecting that the maids here</i>
<i>would do the same is unrealistic.</i>

09:16.681 --> 09:19.517
<i>In the end, they turned it into</i>
<i>a storage room to cover it up.</i>

09:25.231 --> 09:28.609
<i>It's possible that the foundation</i>
<i>itself might be rotting.</i>

09:29.443 --> 09:31.779
Is this building older than the others?

09:32.280 --> 09:34.824
No, it’s actually newer.

09:34.907 --> 09:37.660
It was built when Lady Lishu
entered the palace.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.787
<i>It’s in this state after just a few years?</i>

09:40.663 --> 09:43.749
<i>Lady Lishu mentioned the curtain moving.</i>

09:46.711 --> 09:48.379
Show me the bath.

09:52.216 --> 09:53.050
<i>There it is.</i>

09:53.884 --> 09:55.219
<i>This hole should lead</i>

09:55.303 --> 09:58.055
<i>to the waterway of the rear palace.</i>

09:58.806 --> 10:00.057
-Lady Lishu.
-Oh?

10:00.641 --> 10:02.518
On the day the ghost appeared,

10:02.602 --> 10:05.479
did you, by any chance,
accidentally drain the bathwater?

10:07.148 --> 10:08.190
How did you know?

10:08.274 --> 10:09.692
I knew it!

10:10.443 --> 10:11.861
<i>Sealed windows,</i>

10:12.361 --> 10:13.904
<i>swaying curtains,</i>

10:13.988 --> 10:16.782
<i>and a drained bathtub.</i>

10:17.325 --> 10:19.577
<i>If my deduction is correct,</i>

10:19.660 --> 10:21.912
<i>the dancing ghost is…</i>

10:29.503 --> 10:30.671
Lord Gaoshun,

10:30.755 --> 10:33.716
could you help me move this shelf?

10:33.799 --> 10:34.925
Certainly.

10:39.388 --> 10:41.015
This is terrible.

10:41.098 --> 10:43.434
Yes, it's rotting badly.

10:45.353 --> 10:47.730
<i>The floor is warped and creating gaps.</i>

10:48.230 --> 10:50.024
<i>That would mean…</i>

10:50.107 --> 10:53.486
Could we check if there's
a water channel beneath here?

10:53.569 --> 10:56.489
I'll prepare the architectural plans
immediately.

10:58.491 --> 11:01.285
-Here they are.
-Thank you.

11:04.038 --> 11:06.791
As I suspected, there’s
a water channel beneath this floor.

11:07.458 --> 11:09.210
If hot water flows under here,

11:09.293 --> 11:12.296
the steam would cause the floor
and walls to rot more easily.

11:12.380 --> 11:13.547
<i>And the steam</i>

11:13.631 --> 11:17.093
<i>rising through these gaps</i>
<i>would create airflow,</i>

11:17.176 --> 11:18.803
<i>making the curtains sway.</i>

11:20.304 --> 11:23.682
Then… what was that face I saw?

11:26.394 --> 11:27.228
Ah, that.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.275
Um, that is…

11:34.360 --> 11:35.861
That mirror is

11:35.945 --> 11:39.031
important to me.
Please handle it with care.

11:39.740 --> 11:42.660
Understood. How long has this been here?

11:42.743 --> 11:45.162
I used to use it often.

11:45.246 --> 11:48.249
But now I have the mirror
that was sent by the envoy.

11:49.083 --> 11:51.252
<i>The envoy’s mirror is made of glass</i>

11:51.335 --> 11:53.587
<i>and reflects far better</i>
<i>than a bronze mirror.</i>

11:53.671 --> 11:57.174
<i>It’s understandable that</i>
<i>she put her old mirror away. Even so…</i>

11:57.675 --> 11:59.844
Do you polish this every day?

12:00.970 --> 12:03.722
Yes, it was my mother’s.

12:05.224 --> 12:09.186
<i>At a glance,</i>
<i>it looks like an ordinary bronze mirror…</i>

12:11.063 --> 12:12.189
Lady Lishu,

12:12.273 --> 12:15.401
since we have the mirror here,
how about using it again?

12:16.735 --> 12:17.736
Please, go ahead.

12:21.157 --> 12:22.908
Use it…?

12:24.118 --> 12:27.746
It’s easier to see
if you use it in a bright spot.

12:33.169 --> 12:36.255
If you angle it this way,
you might get a clearer reflection.

12:45.139 --> 12:47.975
<i>I see, so that’s how it appears.</i>

12:48.058 --> 12:49.518
What does this mean?

12:50.102 --> 12:51.812
It’s called a "magic mirror."

12:51.896 --> 12:54.231
This is my first time seeing a real one.

12:54.315 --> 12:55.232
A magic mirror?

12:55.316 --> 12:58.027
<i>It’s also known as</i>
<i>a "transmission mirror."</i>

12:58.110 --> 13:00.613
<i>When light bounces off it,</i>

13:00.696 --> 13:02.740
<i>it mysteriously forms images or text.</i>

13:02.823 --> 13:05.993
<i>The technique involves engraving patterns</i>
<i>into the mirror’s surface</i>

13:06.076 --> 13:08.162
<i>during its creation.</i>

13:08.245 --> 13:10.581
It requires considerable craftsmanship,

13:10.664 --> 13:12.791
something my foster father once told me.

13:16.921 --> 13:20.090
<i>A polished mirror catches the moonlight,</i>

13:20.174 --> 13:21.175
<i>reflecting a face.</i>

13:22.051 --> 13:23.677
<i>Steam rises through the gaps,</i>

13:24.261 --> 13:25.638
<i>making the curtain sway.</i>

13:27.306 --> 13:31.101
<i>In conclusion, a series of coincidences</i>

13:31.185 --> 13:33.187
<i>created this "ghost."</i>

13:34.063 --> 13:38.400
That face… It looks like my late mother.

13:39.360 --> 13:40.945
Maybe she was angry

13:41.028 --> 13:44.823
because I stopped using her mirror.

13:45.366 --> 13:47.201
Maybe that’s why she appeared.

13:48.202 --> 13:49.954
It was just a coincidence.

13:50.663 --> 13:52.998
I heard that she loved to dance.

13:53.082 --> 13:56.794
But after giving birth to me,
she fell ill and could no longer dance.

13:56.877 --> 13:59.171
And then she passed away.

13:59.255 --> 14:02.049
Maybe she became a ghost
so she could dance again.

14:02.841 --> 14:04.385
Ghosts don't--

14:13.936 --> 14:15.646
<i>At her age,</i>

14:15.729 --> 14:18.148
<i>she should be able to</i>
<i>enjoy life more freely.</i>

14:18.232 --> 14:21.026
<i>But polishing her mother’s mirror</i>
<i>every day</i>

14:21.110 --> 14:24.446
<i>might have been her way</i>
<i>of finding solace in the palace.</i>

14:25.614 --> 14:28.659
<i>I don’t understand</i>
<i>what it’s like to long for one’s mother.</i>

14:29.451 --> 14:32.204
<i>But to Lady Lishu,</i>

14:32.288 --> 14:34.999
<i>her mother must have been someone</i>
<i>worth cherishing.</i>

14:38.586 --> 14:40.754
I hope he likes it.

14:40.838 --> 14:42.256
Pardon the interruption.

14:42.339 --> 14:45.134
We've prepared tea outside.

14:49.388 --> 14:53.726
Lady Lishu, why are you crying?

14:53.809 --> 14:56.103
It’s improper to show such emotion
in front of everyone.

14:56.770 --> 15:00.482
<i>She speaks as if she’s a devoted maid,</i>

15:00.566 --> 15:03.277
<i>but her true nature seeps through.</i>

15:03.360 --> 15:05.154
<i>Such an obvious act.</i>

15:05.237 --> 15:07.656
Oh my, that mirror?

15:07.740 --> 15:10.534
You still have it?

15:11.785 --> 15:14.914
The envoy gifted you a far superior one,

15:14.997 --> 15:16.749
so you don’t need this anymore.

15:17.499 --> 15:20.002
-Why not bestow it upon someone else?
-Give it…

15:20.085 --> 15:21.712
Pardon?

15:22.421 --> 15:26.216
Give it back! Give it back!

15:28.886 --> 15:29.720
What is wrong with you!

15:30.596 --> 15:33.098
Such disgraceful behavior
in front of guests!

15:33.182 --> 15:36.352
That is something very precious
to Lady Lishu.

15:36.977 --> 15:40.606
Taking it without proper consideration
seems inappropriate.

15:51.075 --> 15:52.993
Was this item bestowed upon you?

15:55.079 --> 15:57.915
Even if it was,

15:57.998 --> 16:00.167
for a mere maid to wear an ornament

16:00.250 --> 16:02.336
bearing the crest
of a high-ranking consort…

16:04.213 --> 16:06.799
did you not find that inappropriate?

16:10.260 --> 16:13.764
<i>Lord Jinshi must have</i>
<i>known that Lady Lishu</i>

16:13.847 --> 16:15.683
<i>was being disregarded by her maids.</i>

16:16.558 --> 16:18.310
<i>He kept quiet</i>

16:18.394 --> 16:20.813
<i>to preserve her dignity.</i>

16:21.605 --> 16:25.401
<i>But with physical evidence,</i>
<i>he can finally put them in their place.</i>

16:26.777 --> 16:31.156
From now on, refrain from actions
that exceed your position.

16:43.877 --> 16:45.045
<i>He's terrifying.</i>

16:49.758 --> 16:52.177
-Isn't that him?
-So charming!

16:52.261 --> 16:55.055
Here to peek at the newcomers again?

16:56.640 --> 16:59.685
Yeah, yeah. I get it, Maomao.

17:01.103 --> 17:05.232
Young lady, are you researching more
anesthetic-like medicines again?

17:05.315 --> 17:06.233
Yes.

17:06.316 --> 17:10.112
They don’t make new eunuchs anymore,
so there’s no need to investigate that.

17:10.821 --> 17:14.575
By the way,
how do eunuchs enter the rear palace?

17:14.658 --> 17:16.618
Through surgery.

17:16.702 --> 17:17.828
No, I mean,

17:17.911 --> 17:20.831
how do they prove they’re eunuchs?

17:22.041 --> 17:24.752
In the past, a certificate was enough,

17:24.835 --> 17:26.795
but due to fraud,

17:27.838 --> 17:29.465
now they undergo a physical examination.

17:30.049 --> 17:30.924
They grab it?

17:31.008 --> 17:33.385
You’re too blunt, young lady!

17:34.178 --> 17:35.512
To prevent fraud,

17:35.596 --> 17:38.724
three officials from different departments
conduct the examination,

17:38.807 --> 17:40.642
and if nothing is there,
they’re allowed in.

17:40.726 --> 17:42.686
Are they only checked one time?

17:42.770 --> 17:45.355
They check every time they enter and exit.

17:45.939 --> 17:47.274
<i>Only the Emperor</i>

17:47.357 --> 17:50.819
<i>and his blood relatives can enter</i>
<i>the rear palace without being eunuchs.</i>

17:51.320 --> 17:53.739
<i>Does that mean Lord Jinshi is…</i>

17:53.822 --> 17:55.866
<i>No, that can’t be.</i>

17:56.450 --> 17:57.618
Speaking of eunuchs,

17:57.701 --> 18:00.537
have you heard about the new recruits?

18:02.122 --> 18:04.666
<i>Xiaolan and Shisui mentioned it.</i>

18:04.750 --> 18:08.712
I've heard rumors,
about 30 of them entered, right?

18:08.796 --> 18:10.422
Exactly!

18:10.506 --> 18:14.218
Many of them are young and good-looking,
so everyone's excited!

18:14.843 --> 18:17.137
The other day,
one of them got tangled up with

18:17.221 --> 18:20.682
a lower-ranked consort while preparing
the bath. It was quite the scene!

18:20.766 --> 18:23.185
<i>He actually went to check them out?</i>

18:24.019 --> 18:25.938
When exactly do you plan to tell her?

18:26.021 --> 18:27.898
Eventually.

18:27.981 --> 18:31.777
Your attitude is
so obvious, it's unnatural.

18:32.277 --> 18:35.781
Even Maomao looked at you
like you were a dried-up worm.

18:37.241 --> 18:39.159
Shut up. I know.

18:40.119 --> 18:43.831
If you don’t decide soon,
things will get messy.

18:43.914 --> 18:47.209
You want me to bring her over
to our side immediately, right?

18:47.292 --> 18:50.003
But the strategist will intervene.

18:50.087 --> 18:52.548
Fight poison with poison.

18:54.591 --> 18:56.635
<i>Dai Kan Lakan.</i>

18:56.718 --> 18:59.847
<i>A man who took his family’s estate from</i>
<i>his biological father and half-brother</i>

18:59.930 --> 19:01.723
<i>years ago,</i>
<i>becoming the head of the Luo clan.</i>

19:02.474 --> 19:04.977
<i>Even the emperor acknowledges him.</i>

19:05.936 --> 19:07.938
<i>Despite holding the rank</i>
<i>of Grand Commandant,</i>

19:08.021 --> 19:11.567
<i>he remains unaffiliated with any faction,</i>
<i>deftly avoiding entanglements.</i>

19:12.401 --> 19:14.778
<i>Many have tried to strike him down,</i>

19:14.862 --> 19:18.740
<i>but those who dared</i>
<i>suffered far worse than just burns.</i>

19:20.075 --> 19:22.077
<i>No one understands</i>

19:22.161 --> 19:23.996
<i>what goes on inside his head.</i>

19:24.538 --> 19:26.081
<i>The unspoken rule in court</i>

19:26.165 --> 19:29.084
<i>is to avoid him.</i>

19:29.751 --> 19:33.046
<i>But if I plan to bring Maomao in,</i>

19:33.130 --> 19:35.007
<i>I can’t ignore this.</i>

19:36.008 --> 19:38.010
<i>I want to tell her the truth.</i>

19:38.093 --> 19:40.012
<i>Why I hold this position,</i>

19:40.095 --> 19:42.598
<i>and why I hide my true identity.</i>

19:42.681 --> 19:44.099
<i>I want her to know.</i>

19:44.725 --> 19:47.269
<i>But after that, how will she react?</i>

19:51.315 --> 19:54.776
Another rear palace complaint?
Why so many?

19:55.527 --> 19:58.739
Half of them are concerning
Consort Loulan.

19:58.822 --> 20:00.449
They say that
she has too many palace women,

20:00.532 --> 20:03.869
her excessive use of elaborate outfits
is ruining the rear palace's aesthetics,

20:03.952 --> 20:05.370
and so on.

20:05.454 --> 20:07.331
Same complaints as always.

20:07.873 --> 20:10.959
This one is new, though.

20:13.629 --> 20:17.132
"Palace women are
flirting with the new eunuch."

20:17.966 --> 20:19.927
I could’ve guessed.

20:20.010 --> 20:23.263
Yes, we’ve assigned them
to physical labor for now.

20:23.847 --> 20:27.476
We’ll eventually transfer them to
suitable departments based on aptitude,

20:27.559 --> 20:30.520
but they were originally slaves
captured by foreign tribes.

20:31.021 --> 20:32.773
We need to be cautious.

20:34.316 --> 20:37.778
I suppose we should take a look
at least for formality’s sake.

20:37.861 --> 20:39.238
Yes.

20:39.321 --> 20:42.407
-What a hassle.
-Let's just do it.

20:44.534 --> 20:46.620
The ones with white sashes
are the new eunuchs.

20:47.496 --> 20:49.998
They’re thin and seem nervous.

20:50.999 --> 20:53.710
<i>Even after gaining freedom,</i>

20:53.794 --> 20:57.381
<i>former slaves struggle</i>
<i>to live like ordinary citizens.</i>

20:57.464 --> 21:01.051
<i>In some ways,</i>
<i>the rear palace is a suitable refuge.</i>

21:05.472 --> 21:06.932
<i>So that’s the infamous new eunuch, huh?</i>

21:07.557 --> 21:09.851
What happened to his left arm?

21:09.935 --> 21:11.895
He was severely beaten,

21:11.979 --> 21:14.898
leaving his left side partially numb.

21:15.399 --> 21:18.735
His body is covered in scars,
and he refuses to show his skin.

21:18.819 --> 21:19.736
I see.

21:21.613 --> 21:23.907
He’s quite popular, though.

21:23.991 --> 21:26.285
Yes, he’s smart

21:26.368 --> 21:28.578
and knows how to handle
the palace women well.

21:30.539 --> 21:33.792
-What?
-Like you can talk.

21:43.135 --> 21:46.388
-How are the new recruits?
-Lord Jinshi!

21:50.559 --> 21:52.269
They must still be adjusting, but in time,

21:52.352 --> 21:55.731
they’ll be assigned appropriate duties.
Be patient.

21:58.984 --> 22:02.279
What do we do?! That was ice

22:02.362 --> 22:04.406
meant for a high-ranking consort!

22:06.283 --> 22:09.494
Damn it! I’m done for!

22:12.873 --> 22:14.333
I’m so sorry…

23:46.007 --> 23:49.010
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.394 --> 23:59.437
<i>The next episode is "Ice."</i>

23:59.521 --> 24:01.523
